# Change the voice
@scenario office_lesson_20
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk wave]
pip: A spoken line and a note from a teammate can use different presentation modes.
[mode dialogue nvl]
narrator: The last person in the office left a note by the keyboard.
[mode dialogue standard]
pip: Compare a narrated beat and a spoken beat. Restore standard dialogue before leaving.
@label check
pip: Why restore the dialogue mode at the boundary?
> So the character art is deleted. -> retry
> So the next scene opens with its intended layout. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Presentation can persist across scene boundaries. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Presentation can persist across scene boundaries.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_20]
[flag tutorial_done_20]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_4]
